@startuml
title Retry - Full Execution State
hide empty description
[*] --> STARTED
STARTED --> ATTEMPTING
ATTEMPTING --> SUCCESS : success
ATTEMPTING --> NOT_RETRYABLE : STOP
ATTEMPTING --> ABORTED : ABORT
ATTEMPTING --> EXHAUSTED : RETRY + maxAttempts
ATTEMPTING --> TIMED_OUT : maxDuration
ATTEMPTING --> INTERRUPTED : interrupted
ATTEMPTING --> CANCELLED : cancellation
ATTEMPTING --> EXECUTION_FAILED : classifier/backoff failure
ATTEMPTING --> WAITING : RETRY + budget remains
WAITING --> ATTEMPTING : delay completed
WAITING --> INTERRUPTED : sleep interrupted
WAITING --> CANCELLED : cancellation observed
SUCCESS --> [*]
NOT_RETRYABLE --> [*]
ABORTED --> [*]
EXHAUSTED --> [*]
TIMED_OUT --> [*]
INTERRUPTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
EXECUTION_FAILED --> [*]
note right
终态名称与 RetryStatus 一致。
STARTED / ATTEMPTING / WAITING 为 [DOC MODEL]。
end note
@enduml
